{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852741576237121561","name":"the-mounds🕷🕸","position":79,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"A major feywild park on the east edge of Ferrytown, the mostly flat but with small mounds of earth terrain of The Mounds makes it home to many fey who live under the small mounds. Its proximity to Hampstead and the associated gloom means it is a main dwelling place for Unseelie fey. It is also home to Whitehollow Cemetery, a fey graveyard filled with white birch trees; and the blessed tangle, a large tree home to temples to various spider deities","type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
