atues in a central room.","created_at":"2021-07-20T21:31:49.503000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867156872934195232","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"“I re-cog-nize… two of those… one is old world, yes?”","created_at":"2021-07-20T21:32:21.962000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867157009077370910","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"She nods slightly. \"Lolth is from the old world, though in some ways Anansi is as well. I am of the belief that Anansi had been split, but I assume you did not come here to discuss theological arguments.\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T21:35:59.729000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867157922458763334","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"“No… but… in-ter-est-ing… who is this?” He points to Web","created_at":"2021-07-20T21:53:19.460000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867162283406524497","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"\"Ah, that is Web. They're relatively new to prominence, but they are quite popular. Their domains are spiders, family, the sewers, and curiosity.\" She pauses for a second. \"I take it you are religious yourself? You seem a person of faith yourself.\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T22:02:46.733000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867164662721937409","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"“In… the-o-ry… yes. But no close ties… to gods…”","created_at":"2021-07-20T22:09:14.799000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867166290388320306","reply_to_id":"867164662721937409","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"“How do they… think of fam-i-ly?”","created_at":"2021-07-20T22:10:02.714000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867166491358527509","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"\"In a lot of ways. They place emphasis on all kinds of family, from those of blood to those found. \"","created_at":"2021-07-20T22:17:19.485000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867168323309535264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
