{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"Nolan pulls himself away from the religious texts after an hour.","created_at":"2021-07-20T23:51:36.494000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867192050524618763","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"After your hour of reading and studying, you know that Web is a being who was part-spider, and part person. The literature seems pretty literal in detailing them ascending to godhood, though done details seem to imply it is a parable or metaphor. Their tenets focus on the power of families, especially those not of blood; the importance of helping others and working to build a good future for others and defending freedom and the downtrodden.","created_at":"2021-07-20T23:52:50.167000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867192359531315250","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
