{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"(What does he say?)","created_at":"2021-07-21T00:12:08.787000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867197219135160340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"“I have… just been ac-quaint-ed with you… and your his-tory. I nev-er thought I… would find a god like you… who cares for the things…. others would not. Gods…. Often do not pro-tect… un-sight-ly things. Like the sewers… found fam-i-ly… in-sects… I did not know… a god like you… ex-is-ted. I wish… to fol-low your tenets… and put my faith… in you.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T00:22:28.111000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867199816768946186","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
